# H5 (run 5 of 5): the AUDITS-OFF HANG SHAPES at eight seats on c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-best-sdpamulti (QWEN_FAST_TP4_SDPA=multi, audits off). The multi arm allocates new persistent device buffers at attach (the stacked page table,
# the cur_pos words, the mask) and adds the gather and the one-launch SDPA to the verify trace: a change to the allocation sequence and the capture set. The repo rule (docs/tp4-recurrence-split.md, docs/tp4-traced-publish.md G3) is FIVE
# CONSECUTIVE clean runs of the audits-off hang shapes for any such change. A1 is audited and audits-on has historically passed the deterministic hang point, so A1 cannot show this hang. The shapes: concurrent4_steady,
# concurrent8_steady (the quad blocks' mix), steady_resend (an engine build after many packed rounds), replay_concurrent4 and replay_concurrent8, the exactness reference concurrent8_code_equal, then the split-block and drain shapes.
# Each run follows its own all-four reset.
# READ: five CONSECUTIVE completions (H1 to H5), every user at budget, c2_smoke_check clean (engaged config=multi flags=0x21 per block, the call line, two quad markers, a both-quads round, no fallback), no [STALL] dump, no watchdog or
# replay-deadline exit, the concurrent8_code_equal hashes equal in every run and equal to A1's. A stall waits for the job timeout and records nothing, which is itself the finding.
# A stall or a hang here stops the window and the timing pair is skipped. Duration (estimate): 90 min. Stop rule: one stall stops the window.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/sdpa-multi eight-seat 262k development window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/sdpa-multi and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a
# registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-sdpa-multi-1 is what B0 builds from the pushed tp4/sdpa-multi commit; every later job serves that one image. A commit of a
# file the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-sdpa-multi-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-best-sdpamulti
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,concurrent4_steady,concurrent8_steady,steady_resend,replay_concurrent4,replay_concurrent8,concurrent8_code_equal,concurrent5_split,concurrent8_drain
